# prewiredai portfolio

Bryce Nelson's public site, built on Ryan Fitzgerald's devportfolio (Astro, Tailwind CSS v4, MIT).

## Content

- Change copy in `src/config.ts` only, unless a section needs a new field.
- Do not invent metrics, clients, testimonials, dates, or skills.
- Missing facts go in `TODO.md` or as code comments. Never render the word TODO. Never fake data.
- Do not name the current employer. Use "a national smart-home company."
- Do not add a phone number, Salesforce, Figma, formal UX, or a reporting-automation case study.
- Keep the MIT license and the Ryan Fitzgerald credit.

## Code

- Astro components, Tailwind utility classes, IBM Plex Mono.
- New sections read from config and render nothing when their data is empty.
- `npm run build` must pass.
